//
// A text field that is sorted or compared by range follows the collation of its column, and
// criteria order strings by code point: add `COLLATE "C"` to those columns in the migration
// (`ALTER TABLE ... ALTER COLUMN room TYPE text COLLATE "C"`), which the schema cannot say.
//
// Every field of your row is optional: a deleted row keeps its key and its stamp, and NULL in
